### Korak A: Pokretanje novog TCP skeniranja (POST)
POST https://localhost:7049/api/scan/tcp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "host": "127.0.0.1",
  "startPort": 78,
  "endPort": 82
}

### Korak B: Provera statusa posla (GET)
GET https://localhost:7049/api/scan/22427295-990d-478f-9e71-9b4c3db5332d/status
Accept: application/json

### Korak C: Pokretanje novog UDP skeniranja (POST)
POST https://localhost:7049/api/scan/udp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "host": "127.0.0.1",
  "startPort": 78,
  "endPort": 82
}

### Korak D: Provera statusa posla (GET)
GET https://localhost:7049/api/scan/1f8c7e46-dea5-42cf-80e6-f7da007984ce/status
Accept: application/json

### Korak E: Login - uspešan
POST https://localhost:7049/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "demo-weak", "password": "password" }

### Korak F: Login - pogrešna lozinka
POST https://localhost:7049/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "demo-weak", "password": "pogresno" }

### Korak G: Login - nepostojeći korisnik
POST https://localhost:7049/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "nepostoji", "password": "bilo sta" }

### Korak H: Login - prazan username (očekuje se 400)
POST https://localhost:7049/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "", "password": "password" }

> {%
    client.test("400 Bad Request", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 400, "Expected 400, got " + response.status);
    });
%}